obs This lap updates the Bakery handoff after comparing four parked source versions with landed code. Production source stays unchanged.
obs Read the voice, whole card, inner prompt, named handoffs, newest three shelf rows, prior recommendation, and live claim sentences. Copal owns its bounds control, Pheromone its Glow recovery, Diffuser its motion study, and Grass its money recovery. The claim scan reported overlap_peer=0. This review opens no new instrument or booked repair.
obs Round-open settled on 82d69dbc410c120192a90ede70f8c47f4314633e with a clean tree. The claim scan's later fetch saw one upstream commit. All 85 stashes remain preserved. The current seat transcript was inspected; it contains this lap's stream, so the committed log supplies the prior handoff. The fleet process reader found no local roster runner and refused seven foreign checkouts.
obs Reviewed rye/src/main.rye blob 5b17c1f39fc3e0931fdf98903a9e1894a2b49c18 from stash c301776fff05f30845ffe2a2ce2ce386d578f91a. Its digest-record reader assigns seen_path but omits it from the return gate. The landed file at d305dce6f differs only by the added path refusal, its explanatory comment, and the version stamp and comment. That commit is an ancestor of this lap's HEAD. Restoring the draft would remove a proven repair.
obs Reviewed stash bf774e9c2f05d0e36fce6599d972372bea1b39ef: Rye blob 4d180c6fa854dd266a71c7b94fe88b642d5b5bc5, control blob 4cc62fc53dd36faa7454c060b20965a6e2bccb97, and witness blob 16997c779a0a416cefd3ec45b8569f92965e05ab. This earlier draft adds receipt eligibility before expensive reads, remembered compiler and frontend digests, and five new control sections. Today's source carries those mechanisms plus the later key command, library digest cache, and bounded record eviction.
obs Ancestors 8a3dfac50, d305dce6f, 6bd9e098b, and ace5bca93 establish the landed sequence. Current controls retain compiler-record creation, planted-digest consultation and restoration, wrong-path refusal, same-size in-place rewrite with restored mtime, and no-record behavior for unkeyed commands. They add separate identity-field plants, library membership and metadata plants, and eviction checks. The current witness requires legs=44 or an explicit machine-fact verdict; the parked witness has no leg-count assertion.
obs The parked control changes only the first digest character to zero. Applying that exact sed expression to a synthetic 64-character digest beginning with zero leaves the input unchanged. Today's control replaces the whole digest and compares the planted record against its baseline before trusting the mutation. This shell reproduction confirms the old plant's no-op case; it is not a new compiler runtime proof.
